# 65QNED99UPA, the US 65-inch QNED99 (8K), on W21K's global firmware (HE_DTV_W21K_AFADATAA), the
# OTA id's only US models being it and the 75NANO99UPA. hwopt from the firmware's own hw-option-gen
# (host/tools/research/model-config.py, VALIDATE "W21K"): country digit 5 US/ATSC, a V-by-One 8K LCD
# panel at 120 Hz, DDR 4 GB, graphic plane 3840x2160: W21K's compositor (its Qt with LG's partial
# update) drew nothing on a 1920x1080 plane (eglSetDamageRegion failed, the OSD stayed black) and
# draws Home on the 4K one. ToolOpt: lowlevelstorage's default record of this firmware with the
# QNED99's tool type and 65". countryGrp is configd's USA RMM group, 2.
# chip= as lxboot builds it ("E60" and a revision); A0 is a virtual revision. Identity is synthetic.
ethaddr=02:00:00:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
countryGrp=2
modelopt=000000000
hwopt=502310000109004000
ToolOpt=134218705:13331:69857:73:48358963:825744651
modelName=65QNED99UPA
debugMode=3
serialNum=000RAXX00001
chip=E60A0
tvregion=ATSC
emmc_size=0x1d2000000
cmdEnd
